{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-and-mythos","title":"科学态度与神话化","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/scientific-and-mythos","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"disdain-for-philosophy-and-honors","title":"对哲学与荣誉的轻视","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/scientific-and-mythos/disdain-for-philosophy-and-honors","wordCount":1732,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-feynman-myth","title":"\"费曼神话\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/controversies-and-appraisal/scientific-and-mythos/the-feynman-myth","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 科学态度与神话化\n\n本章审视两个相关的议题：费曼对哲学与荣誉的轻视态度所引发的争议，以及围绕他形成的\"费曼神话\"——过度神化所带来的失真。\n\n第一篇文档讨论费曼对科学哲学的轻蔑与对荣誉头衔的疏离，分析这种态度的合理之处与可商榷之处。第二篇文档讨论\"费曼神话\"现象：他被过度浪漫化、偶像化，以致真实的费曼与传说中的费曼之间出现了偏差。\n"}